  "fullDescription": "Create sweet and charming baby shower designs with this Little Sprout Farmers Market watercolor clipart collection. This premium set includes cute ducklings and goslings, garden market elements, strawberries, lemons, carrots, daisies, bows, baby items, signs, wreaths, and nursery-friendly decorative pieces.\n\nDesigned in a soft kawaii watercolor style with a fresh butter yellow, pistachio green, sage, strawberry blush, and warm cottage market palette, this bundle is perfect for baby shower invitations, nursery wall art, printable decor, party signs, stickers, sublimation designs, mugs, tote bags, greeting cards, scrapbooking, planner stickers, and DIY craft projects.\n\nAll elements are provided as high-resolution PNG files with transparent backgrounds, making them easy to layer into your own designs, invitations, signs, products, and printable projects.\n\nThis collection is especially suited for “Little Sprout,” “Locally Grown Baby,” spring baby shower, summer baby shower, garden party baby shower, farmers market baby shower, and gender neutral nursery themes.\n\nWhat’s Included\n50 individual PNG clipart elements\nTransparent background\nHigh-resolution files\nCute watercolor ducklings and goslings\nFruit, vegetable, floral, market, and baby shower elements\nPerfect for digital and printable designs",
